@startuml
!include style.iuml
mainframe class Facade
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members
title Facade — as built (UML 2.5.1 class diagram)

class BoardController <<client>>
class ApiController <<client>>
interface AllocationService <<interface>> <<facade>> {
  +loadBoard(criteria : JobCriteria, selectedJobId : String) : BoardData
  +findPendingJobs(criteria : JobCriteria) : List<Job>
  +findEligibleWorkers(jobId : String) : List<Candidate>
  +allocate(jobId : String, workerId : String, jobVersion : long) : Allocation
  +autoAllocate(jobIds : List<String>, policyName : String) : List<AutoAllocationResult>
  +unassign(allocationId : String) : void
  +findAllocations(date : LocalDate) : List<AllocationDetail>
  +getJob(jobId : String) : Job
  +getAllocation(allocationId : String) : AllocationDetail
}
package "Subsystem hidden behind the facade" {
  class AllocationServiceImpl
  interface JobDAO <<interface>>
  interface WorkerDAO <<interface>>
  interface AllocationDAO <<interface>>
  interface SkillDAO <<interface>>
  class PolicyFactory
  class DomainEventPublisher
  class Worker
  class Job
}
BoardController --> AllocationService : one loadBoard()\nper page
ApiController --> AllocationService
AllocationService <|.. AllocationServiceImpl
AllocationServiceImpl ..> JobDAO
AllocationServiceImpl ..> WorkerDAO
AllocationServiceImpl ..> AllocationDAO
AllocationServiceImpl ..> SkillDAO
AllocationServiceImpl ..> PolicyFactory
AllocationServiceImpl ..> DomainEventPublisher
AllocationServiceImpl ..> Worker
AllocationServiceImpl ..> Job
note right of AllocationService
  Coarse-grained: loadBoard returns everything the board shows
  in ONE transaction (before: 6 calls, 4 transactions, so the
  page could show an inconsistent snapshot).
  Security and transactions are added by the Proxy (diagram 14).
end note
@enduml
